    "body": "# Daily scope digest 2026-11-21\n\n7 scope change(s) across 5 bug bounty program(s) since the last digest.\n\nDashboard: https://bountywatch.hackmestepbro.com/scope.html\n\n### Mattermost Public Bug Bounty Engagement  (`bc:mattermost-mbb-public`)\nhttps://bugcrowd.com/engagements/mattermost-mbb-public\n- ➕ **scope** added: `https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-channel-export`, `https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-metrics`\n- ➖ **scope** removed: `https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-msteams`\n\n### Newegg (`h1:newegg`)\nhttps://hackerone.com/newegg\n- ➕ **scope** added: `www.sellingpilot.com`\n- ➖ **out-of-scope** removed: `sellingpilot.newegg.com`\n\n### Twilio (`h1:twilio`)\nhttps://hackerone.com/twilio\n- ➕ **scope** added: `verify.twilio.com`\n\n### BOJA Consulting Bug Bounty (`bc:boja`)\nhttps://bugcrowd.com/engagements/boja\n- ➕ **scope** added: `https://marketplace.atlassian.com/apps/2394034939/email-attach-automation-exporter-pdf-word-claude-mcp?hosting=cloud&tab=overview`\n\n### Visa (`h1:visa`)\nhttps://hackerone.com/visa\n- ➕ **scope** added: `https://ebc2test.cybersource.com/currencyconversion`\n\n\ncc @amirmomeni177",
